  skills: ['Analysing Data', 'Communicating with Evidence'],
  bigIdea: 'Our sense of touch gives a rough idea of hot or cold, but never the exact temperature, and different people get different answers. A thermometer measures temperature accurately, in degrees Celsius, and everyone who reads it properly gets the same number.',
  aim: 'Put five cups of water in order by touch, compare with other groups, then measure each cup with a thermometer and see whose order everyone agrees on.',
